# data-source-kit — environment variables
#
# The News/OSINT & gov-feed adapters shipped so far are ALL keyless (auth: none),
# so this file is intentionally empty for now. Keys land here as the keyed pillars
# (aviation / maritime / hazards / conflict) are added — one per adapter that
# declares auth: apiKey | oauth2 | basic-24h in SOURCES_SPEC.md. Examples (not yet
# used):
#
# NASA_FIRMS_API_KEY=
# OPENAQ_API_KEY=
# AVIATIONSTACK_API=
# ACLED_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# UCDP_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# OPENSKY_CLIENT_ID=
# OPENSKY_CLIENT_SECRET=
